<programme start="20261117070000 +0000" stop="20261117100000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Syracuse at NC State</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Wolfpack (4-5, 2-4 ACC) and Orange (4-5, 2-5) continue pursuit of bowl eligibility. NC State fell to 1-1 under interim coach Todd Goebbel following a 41-3 setback against Duke. Syracuse has won two straight meetings after a 24-17 verdict in 2024.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
