<programme start="20261117120000 +0000" stop="20261117150000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Florida State at Pittsburgh</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Pittsburgh Panthers meet the Florida State Seminoles. Pittsburgh (6-3) looks to build on its five sacks in a 34-11 win over Georgia Tech, while 4-5 Florida State is bolstered by two key interceptions in a 31-24 victory over Boston College.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
