<programme start="20261118000000 +0000" stop="20261118020000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Villanova at Pittsburgh</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Villanova Wildcats (3-1) visit the Pittsburgh Panthers (4-0) at Petersen Events Center. Villanova beat Rider 99-62 behind 21 points from Devin Royal, while Pittsburgh seeks to make it five straight wins behind forward Chase Foster.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261118020000 +0000" stop="20261118040000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Old Dominion at Virginia</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Old Dominion Monarchs (5-0) visit the No. 6 Virginia Cavaliers (5-0) for an NCAA game at John Paul Jones Arena. Both teams enter this matchup undefeated, with Old Dominion beating Longwood 80-74 and Virginia beating Maryland 87-83.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
