<programme start="20261116230000 +0000" stop="20261117010000 +0000" channel="BIG Network"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Alcorn State at Maryland</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Maryland Terrapins host the Alcorn State Braves at XFINITY Center in College Park. Alcorn State relies on Calvin Sirmans III who leads the team in points and assists, while Pharrel Payne leads Maryland with over 20 points per game.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
