<programme start="20261117030000 +0000" stop="20261117050000 +0000" channel="BIG Network"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Long Beach State at UCLA</sub-title><desc lang="en">The No. 9 UCLA Bruins (3-0) host the Long Beach State Beach (1-2) at Pauley Pavilion. Long Beach State defeated Pacific 62-59 and earned their first win this season, while UCLA aims for a fourth straight win behind Nikola Kusturica&apos;s 18.3 points.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
