<programme start="20261117190000 +0000" stop="20261117210000 +0000" channel="ESPN 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Rutgers vs. Houston</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Rutgers Scarlet Knights (3-0) face the No. 8 Houston Cougars (3-0) at Michelob Ultra Arena. Both enter undefeated, with Rutgers beating Bryant 72-51 behind Christian Gurdak and Houston topping Jacksonville State 92-46 behind Dedan Thomas Jr.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
