<programme start="20261118000000 +0000" stop="20261118020000 +0000" channel="ESPN 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Illinois at Duke</sub-title><desc lang="en">The No. 3 Illinois Fighting Illini visit the No. 2 Duke Blue Devils. Illinois (3-1) beat Sam Houston 108-86 behind Tomislav Ivisic&apos;s 28 points, while Duke (3-1) topped SIU Edwardsville 90-47 behind Patrick Ngongba II&apos;s 13 points and four assists.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261118020000 +0000" stop="20261118023000 +0000" channel="ESPN 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">College Football Playoff: Top 25</title><desc lang="en">College football&apos;s top teams are debated and discussed in anticipation of the College Football Playoff Selection Committee&apos;s first meeting. Rece Davis hosts with analysis from David Pollack, Joey Galloway and Kirk Herbstreit.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p17487834_b_v11_aa.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261118023000 +0000" stop="20261118043000 +0000" channel="ESPN 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">UNLV vs. Kansas</sub-title><desc lang="en">The UNLV Rebels (3-0) and the No. 15 Kansas Jayhawks (3-0) meet at Michelob Ultra Arena. Both teams enter this matchup undefeated, with UNLV beating Stanford 76-68 behind Cam Miles, while Kansas topped Kentucky 89-69 behind 30 points from Tre White.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
