<programme start="20261118050000 +0000" stop="20261118070000 +0000" channel="ESPN 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">West Virginia vs. Auburn</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Auburn Tigers (2-1) face the West Virginia Mountaineers (3-0) at Michelob ULTRA Arena. West Virginia enters on a three-game win streak after beating Mercer 75-61 behind Finley Bizjack. Auburn fell 80-69 to Arizona and relies on Tahaad Pettiford.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
