<programme start="20261117000000 +0000" stop="20261117020000 +0000" channel="ESPN U"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Western Kentucky at Tulsa</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Tulsa Golden Hurricane (3-0) host the Western Kentucky Hilltoppers (3-1) at Reynolds Center. Tulsa enters with three straight wins and Jaylen Lawal leading with 20 points, while Western Kentucky relies on Teagan Moore who leads with 19.3 points.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
