<programme start="20261117050000 +0000" stop="20261117080000 +0000" channel="ESPN U"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Idaho State at Montana</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Montana Grizzlies (7-3, 5-2 Big Sky) host the Idaho State Bengals (6-4, 3-4 Big Sky) at Washington-Grizzly Stadium. Idaho State hopes to bounce back after a 28-26 3OT loss against Montana State, while Montana aims for a three-game win streak.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261117080000 +0000" stop="20261117110000 +0000" channel="ESPN U"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Kansas State at TCU</sub-title><desc lang="en">The TCU Horned Frogs (4-5, 2-4 Big 12) host the Kansas State Wildcats (4-5, 1-5 Big 12) at Amon G. Carter Stadium in Fort Worth. Kansas State hopes to break a three-game skid behind Avery Johnson, while TCU relies on Jaden Craig to find momentum.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
