<programme start="20261117150000 +0000" stop="20261117180000 +0000" channel="ESPN U"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Duke at Miami</sub-title><desc lang="en">The No. 7 Hurricanes (8-1, 6-0 ACC) try to recover as they host the Blue Devils (7-2, 4-2). Miami, which is without star wideout Malachi Toney, lost 31-24 at Notre Dame last week. Duke has won three straight after dismantling NC State, 41-3.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
